{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScimTokenStatus"}],"title":"ScimTokenStatus","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ScimTokenStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK15ScimTokenStatusO"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/scimtokenstatus"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScimTokenStatus"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"open","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the records the caller did ask for.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"code